---
source: crates/deft-cli/../../tests/unit/help.rs
expression: "help::group(g.name)"
---
deft pdf - commands (input -> output)
  info            pdf -> report      Pages, size, metadata, fonts, images
  compare         pdf... -> report   Compare two PDFs: text and pixels
  compress        pdf -> pdf         Make smaller: --level, --target-size 2MB
  crop            pdf -> pdf         Trim pages: --margin, --box, --auto
  decrypt         pdf -> pdf         Remove a password you know
  delete          pdf -> pdf         Remove pages: --pages 2,5-7
  encrypt         pdf -> pdf         Protect with a password (AES-256)
  extract-images  pdf -> image...    Save embedded pictures, unchanged
  fields          pdf -> report      List form fields and their values
  fill            pdf -> pdf         Fill a form from JSON: --data values.json
  flatten         pdf -> pdf         Bake forms and annotations into pages
  from-images     image... -> pdf    One page per image
  from-md         md -> pdf          Typeset Markdown as PDF
  grayscale       pdf -> pdf         Remove colour, keeping text as text (Ghostscript)
  merge           pdf... -> pdf      Join PDFs in the given order
  meta            pdf -> pdf         Read metadata and bookmarks, or set --title --author
  number          pdf -> pdf         Add page numbers: --format
  ocr             pdf -> pdf|txt     Make a scan searchable
  redact          pdf -> pdf         Black out for good: --box or --text
  repair          pdf -> pdf         Rebuild a damaged PDF (Ghostscript)
  resize          pdf -> pdf         Fit pages to --page-size a4
  rotate          pdf -> pdf         Turn pages clockwise: --angle 90, --pages
  search          pdf -> report      Find text: --text invoice
  select          pdf -> pdf         Keep and reorder pages
  split           pdf -> pdf...      Split: per page, --every N, --ranges
  strip           pdf -> pdf         Remove metadata
  to-docx         pdf -> docx        Editable Word file, layout not kept [beta]
  to-images       pdf -> png|jpg...  Render pages: --dpi, --pages
  to-md           pdf -> md          Text as Markdown paragraphs [beta]
  to-pdfa         pdf -> pdf         Convert for archiving as PDF/A-2 (Ghostscript) [beta]
  to-sheet        pdf -> sheet       Pull tables out by text position [beta]
  to-text         pdf -> txt         Extract text
  watermark       pdf -> pdf         Stamp text or an image on pages
More: deft pdf <command> --help
